{"title":"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many three-digit numbers are not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, have digits that sum to less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and have the first digit equal to the third digit?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/b/e5bad9fdcdf5b068b066ad1988d8154f5ec5ba8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 52 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 60  \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 66 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 68 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use a casework approach to solve the problem. These three digit numbers are of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6be36e143cfe9648096b78ad52f67c1997f721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{xyx}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d6cf4e9d072fbeba4fb13dffe63fa9ca820854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{abc}$\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> denotes the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5a1ceb95b62c9c34572681c80bee6671a5c9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100a+10b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"14\" />).  We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/7470aeade5f47b768b503c1547f7e7cbf4540361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/4/5942743972460bb9c9210f39a95b5789dbd3b71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> does not yield a three-digit integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> yields a number divisible by 5.\n</p><p>The second condition is that the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/48809f617152f90dc9a255e39e41ba5dee394512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+y&lt;20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />.  When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can be any digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f8ee5eb338bdcce4bc7c52a137df3b0b4333c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x&lt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />.  This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/4/16437bf8e8f78747ff427711b11a0de9503b31e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10(4) = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> numbers.  \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd92d02476c3434bf645bf5a3bc249eca83d3c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/734e0f3249fb83d883de0e1a720a16b301fae13a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12+y&lt;20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/65478a5d5cdffa726d7db0942afb6ec5913c4f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.  This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more numbers.  \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b72c5ea9901d864791e4a989fcc40321f2a4cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14+y&lt;20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53b1aeb9976dea14cd71fe6ae5b911016c775752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.  This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more numbers.  \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccf5d650726be49af3a306c54a2fd7dd1d628b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/8788b8aa1d97c78259a4632b7e25798d0328b34a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16+y&lt;20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d76bfc9cc7d48ac3f4d8445fa0c75ef51c16b9e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more numbers.  \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1d8cdec48abe8293a4169a8afce4fc8a8348e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d7d1063822f773b5976a720519f140169a5aeac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18+y&lt;20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a261b71b48ceea8803ceaba56f60c3e75657df5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more numbers.  \n</p><p>Summing, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/960b860b9824b158e022b3e9b44464c23770d154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 + 8 + 6 + 4 + 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"232\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A\">2013 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.